  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will seek to understand how to best support youth from poor communities and provide academic and business training that prepares them for gainful employment and/or future academic study. The common goal for Destined Youth Initative Kenya and Inkululeko is to ensure beneficiaries gain leadership skills, have an opportunity to use those skills to demonstrate improved resilience in solving unemployment problems through well defined project activities such as use of digital skills, agribusiness, community engagement, employability, entrepreneurship skills and literacy programs. Countries: Kenya and South Africa</narrative>
  </description>
